    {
      "association_text": "Faecalibacterium genus relative abundance was significantly higher in anti-PD-1 responders versus non-responders in a newly recruited independent cohort of 132 metastatic melanoma patients (n=87 responders, n=45 non-responders; p=0.018 by Wilcoxon rank sum test), supporting its role as a gut microbiota marker of immunotherapy response.",
