      "association_text": "Faecalibacterium genus was significantly enriched in anti-PD-1 responders versus non-responders in the gut microbiome of 43 metastatic melanoma patients (30R, 13NR; FDR-adjusted pairwise comparisons and LEfSe; p<0.01), establishing the original human evidence for genus-level enrichment as a marker of immunotherapy response.",
